<!--T:77-->
The Wikimedia Foundation Board of Trustees [[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Resolutions</tvar>|releases official policies]] from time to time. Some of these policies may be mandatory for a particular Project or Project edition, and, when they are, you agree to abide by them as applicable.
